Z||000008||stimpy||01-21-2001||05:32 PM||||I have a Flowie on my car. How do I tell what model it is?  I believe mine is the ne designed for Camaro. I really don't think that mine is considerably louder then stock, it just has a raspier, more snarly note to it. Of course, I didn't realize really how loud it is until my stereo got stolen Thurs night. I keep going through drive through windows and reaching to my absent radio to turn the volume down. hehe.||||reg||1
Z||000009||1FST2M6||01-21-2001||07:03 PM||||for less than the $140 he wants for his 2.25" unit get a 2.5" crossflow and install that.. it'll save you $70 and flow better.  the 2.5? on GT Bastards car  is KILLER! flows great.. not annoying in the car.. but BRUTAL to a dork in a Mustang with onlly an H-pipe...<BR> <A HREF="http://www.brullenexhaust.com" TARGET=_blank>www.brullenexhaust.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.powertone.com" TARGET=_blank>www.powertone.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.spintechmufflers.com" TARGET=_blank>www.spintechmufflers.com</A>   <A HREF="http://www.borla.com" TARGET=_blank>www.borla.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.flowmastermufflers.com" TARGET=_blank>www.flowmastermufflers.com</A> <P>if your really are stuck on the chris west unit msweldon has one for sale never used or installed for less than Chris sells it..  Marc is gunna have a 2.5 or 3" unit installed on his 3.4TDC.<P><BR>oh.. as for the resonance issue.. uum no.. the only reason you have resonance is cause the passenger compartment is right over the muffler..  the way the fiero is set up.. you'll have HELLA resonance in the trunk.. so your bags/nitrous bottle/RC Car will have hearing issues but you won't.  unless you have a straight pipe with no expansion chamber.. THEN your rattle your eyeballs out... <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 01-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||terryk||01-21-2001||07:05 PM||||The muffler is available from <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com." TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com.</A>  Looks for the mufffler tab. Says it's 2.5" in and dual 2" out.<P>How do you know what model? The number equals the quantity of dead animals in your wake.....<P><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 01-21-2001).]||||reg||1
