Z||000012||danny boy||01-21-2001||08:25 PM|||| I have one on my other car and it sounds great.Its a 40series crossflow for a camaro and is 3" in,2.5" out with 3.5" pilot tips I got at Advance auto.I'm running 3" pipe and a Catco cat.Hella power difference too.||||reg||14
